<title>USA: EnviroDerm says wins FDA clearance for IvyBlock.</title>
<headline>EnviroDerm says wins FDA clearance for IvyBlock.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EnviroDerm Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday it won regulatory clearance to market IvyBlock, to protect the skin from poison ivy, poison oak and poison sumac.</p>
<p>Enviroderm, owned by United Catalysts, said it was approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to sell IvyBlock over the counter. It expects IvyBlock to be available within the next three to six months and will have a suggested retail price for a 4-ounce bottle of under $10.</p>
</text>
